178
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:54,310
 The Great Pyramid is equal to or exceeds the greatest monuments on Earth in their size.

179
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:09,750
 Passes, seasons, one after another, and years go by. Our tumulus is now almost finished.

180
